**Recipe provenance (template behaviour).** Commands are real
invocation shapes; expected output is a shape with placeholders, never
an invented transcript; anything not worked against a real pin
renders as an explicit `PENDING` marker. The provenance footnote uses
the guide's compact form:

ref: [{{TOOL_VERSION}}]({{PIN_SOURCE_URL}}) - verified {{VERIFIED_AT}}

(plus, only when honest, a one-line smoke/missing-surface note with
its link). If the pin of any named tool moves without this recipe
being re-worked, the recipe is stale — update it in the same change.
